  "fields": {
    "name": {
      "value": "卡茜亚",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:3a33ab0f4131eef0a520a5d296c5fe8c3ba22a8c202c1cf81f6833f974f0e202",
      "status": "reference"
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "来跳舞吧，欢快地、疯狂地跳，直到气氛沸腾。聚光灯下，疯癫的魔术师卡茜亚已经把手伸进帽中，而下一幕取出的东西未必适合观众观看。",
      "sourceHash": "sha256:423f46429c80c61e55d1ac453d3cccf971fb3c043441ef61d4c1deead51e213a",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  }
}
